# անց ("past") counts UP from the named hour, which is the CURRENT hour:
# "ութ անց կես" is 08:30.  ու ("and") fills the same slot in the standard
# modern phrasing "ժամը վեցն ու կեսն է" (06:30).  Source: en.wiktionary.org,
# անց (postposition, worked example "ութ անց կես" -- half past eight).
անց
ու
